{"unit_id":"4399Accelerator__dsh-study-planner#card-zh","repo":"4399Accelerator/dsh-study-planner","commit":"da80959f0292a4b279b69c6a08225bd78d069256","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-study-planner 是 DSH 的 Web 学习计划插件，在会话视图中加入「学习计划」标签。它从本机数据目录读取计划 JSON，并通过宿主接口保存打卡进度；可以查看按周和每日组织的主题、知识点、阅读、练习、课后题及完成标准，按日期推荐当天任务，并记录每日完成、练习勾选和备注。侧栏汇总完成比例、学习时长、连续打卡与题目进度，也提供日历、多计划切换和计划目标提示词。适合希望在 DSH 对话旁安排并持续追踪个人学习任务的用户。无需 API Key 或外部服务，计划由对话中的 AI 生成，数据保存在本机。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:837-848","client.js:287-294","client.js:378-437","index.js:30-44","index.js:243-378"]}
{"unit_id":"4399Accelerator__dsh-study-planner#card-en","repo":"4399Accelerator/dsh-study-planner","commit":"da80959f0292a4b279b69c6a08225bd78d069256","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-study-planner adds a Study Plan tab to DSH Web conversations. It displays local weekly plans, daily tasks, exercises and checklists. Learners can record check-ins, track progress, switch plans and set a start date. A prompt helper sends goals to the chat AI. Data stays local.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:837-848","client.js:287-294","client.js:378-437","index.js:30-44","index.js:243-378"]}
