{"unit_id":"4399Accelerator__dsh-study-planner#feature-1","repo":"4399Accelerator/dsh-study-planner","commit":"da80959f0292a4b279b69c6a08225bd78d069256","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-study-planner 的功能「学习计划视图」：在 DSH 会话标签中展示所选计划的周主题、每日知识点、阅读和实践任务。进入标签后载入计划，用户可选中一天查看详细内容。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:544-593","client.js:680-725","client.js:837-848"]}
{"unit_id":"4399Accelerator__dsh-study-planner#feature-2","repo":"4399Accelerator/dsh-study-planner","commit":"da80959f0292a4b279b69c6a08225bd78d069256","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-study-planner 的功能「进度与每日打卡」：侧栏显示完成天数、累计分钟、连续打卡和课后题完成情况；用户可标记每日完成、勾选题目及完成标准，并保存当天备注。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:88-124","client.js:378-437","client.js:680-814","index.js:243-303"]}
